<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">lake-iron-hook-spear</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A long-shafted spear of refined lake-iron with a back-curving hook
welded to the socket — the smith's adaptation of a fisher's gaff
for a fighter's hand. The hook catches a parrying weapon and drags
it offline.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 22)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> lake-iron nodule (x3), iron ingot (x1),
                 leather strip (x1)

